[32m+[m[32m## GNN-Inspired Pairwise MLP for 3D DoA Estimation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis folder contains a graph-inspired regression model that learns spatial[m
[32m+[m[32mrelationships using pairwise microphone features.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Pipeline[m
[32m+[m[32m0. Frame-based chunking (4 × 2048)[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Compute complex STFT per frame[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Construct 12 ordered microphone-pair features[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Split dataset into train/val/test CSVs[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Train pairwise MLP + fusion MLP[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Feature Structure[m
[32m+[m[32mEach microphone pair contains:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real & imaginary STFT components of both microphones[m
[32m+[m[32m- 3D coordinates of both microphones[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFinal input shape: (12, 4F + 6)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Model Characteristics[m
[32m+[m[32m- Output: Continuous azimuth & elevation[m
[32m+[m[32m- Loss: Mean Squared Error (MSE)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Optimizer: AdamW[m
[32m+[m[32m- Parameters: ~1.17M[m
