[32m+[m[32m# 3D Direction of Arrival Estimation Using a Tetrahedral Microphone Array[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis repository contains the complete implementation of two deep learning models developed[m
[32m+[m[32mduring an internship at CSIR-CSIO, Chandigarh, for three-dimensional Direction of Arrival (DoA)[m
[32m+[m[32mestimation using a custom-built 4-channel tetrahedral microphone array.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe work is based on real multichannel recordings collected in an anechoic environment and[m
[32m+[m[32mpresents a comparative study between a classification-based CRNN and a regression-based[m
[32m+[m[32mGNN-inspired MLP model.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Models Implemented[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 1. CRNN-Based DoA Estimation[m
[32m+[m[32m- Input: 0.25s multichannel audio chunks[m
[32m+[m[32m- Features: dB-scaled STFT spectrograms (4 × F × T)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Task: Discrete direction classification (36 classes)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Architecture: Conv2D + BatchNorm + BiGRU[m
[32m+[m[32m- Strength: High accuracy and stable convergence[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 2. GNN-Inspired Pairwise MLP[m
[32m+[m[32m- Input: Single-frame complex STFTs[m
[32m+[m[32m- Features: 12 ordered microphone-pair feature vectors[m
[32m+[m[32m- Task: Continuous azimuth and elevation regression[m
[32m+[m[32m- Architecture: Pairwise MLP + Fusion MLP[m
[32m+[m[32m- Strength: Lightweight, flexible, regression-capable[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Microphone Array Geometry[m
[32m+[m[32mA tetrahedral microphone array with 8 cm spacing between all microphones was used,[m
[32m+[m[32menabling full 3D spatial localization (azimuth + elevation).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Dataset[m
[32m+[m[32mThe dataset was recorded using a physical tetrahedral microphone array in an anechoic[m
[32m+[m[32mchamber at CSIR-CSIO. It consists of recordings from 36 unique directions[m
[32m+[m[32m(12 azimuth × 3 elevation).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDue to institutional and privacy constraints, the dataset is not publicly available.[m
[32m+[m[32mAll preprocessing, training, and evaluation code is provided for reproducibility.[m
